    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Step Into the Shoes of a Detective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the chilling mystery behind the walls of <strong>Hotel Noir</strong>, a once-peaceful retreat hidden in the highlands of Western Europe. Your arrival is quickly overshadowed by a shocking murder, and only <strong>you</strong> can uncover the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d Investigate, Interrogate, Trust No One</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a classic detective adventure where every clue matters. Explore richly detailed environments, question suspicious characters, and piece together the evidence. Be careful who you believe, nothing is quite as it seems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 A Visual Feast for Mystery Lovers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in colorful, hand-crafted scenes, smooth animations, and eye-catching 3D effects that bring the story to life. Whether you're solving puzzles or chasing leads, every moment is filled with atmosphere and intrigue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde9 Features That Keep You Coming Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Variety of gameplay including hidden object scenes, spot-the-difference challenges, logical puzzles, and object restoration<br>\u2022 Replayable scenes with new quests and collectible rewards<br>\u2022 Flexible experience with no time limits, plus bonus rewards for speed and accuracy</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready to Crack the Case?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love immersive storytelling, clever puzzles, and atmospheric mysteries, <strong>Hotel Noir</strong> is calling. Sharpen your instincts, trust no one, and uncover what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Start your investigation today! The truth won\u2019t wait.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Step Into the Shoes of a Detective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the chilling mystery behind the walls of <strong>Hotel Noir</strong>, a once-peaceful retreat hidden in the highlands of Western Europe. Your arrival is quickly overshadowed by a shocking murder, and only <strong>you</strong> can uncover the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d Investigate, Interrogate, Trust No One</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a classic detective adventure where every clue matters. Explore richly detailed environments, question suspicious characters, and piece together the evidence. Be careful who you believe, nothing is quite as it seems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 A Visual Feast for Mystery Lovers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in colorful, hand-crafted scenes, smooth animations, and eye-catching 3D effects that bring the story to life. Whether you're solving puzzles or chasing leads, every moment is filled with atmosphere and intrigue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde9 Features That Keep You Coming Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Variety of gameplay including hidden object scenes, spot-the-difference challenges, logical puzzles, and object restoration<br>\u2022 Replayable scenes with new quests and collectible rewards<br>\u2022 Flexible experience with no time limits, plus bonus rewards for speed and accuracy</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ready to Crack the Case?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love immersive storytelling, clever puzzles, and atmospheric mysteries, <strong>Hotel Noir</strong> is calling. Sharpen your instincts, trust no one, and uncover what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Start your investigation today! The truth won\u2019t wait.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\udd0d Solve the mystery behind a shocking murder at Hotel Noir! \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Search for hidden objects, uncover clues, and piece together the truth. But remember... trust no one!",
